    "Thread (i): whether the emergency cgroup weights were deliberately
     reverted or reset — documented state contradicts live state.",
    "Thread (g): whether the deployed recovery_exercise.py was fixed and only
     the repo copy is stale, or the gate still runs with old names.",
  ]
}

